Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven appears to be there after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that place is at Cape Canaveral\NSpace Center, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At the beginning of\Neverything, there was gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the friend who was\Naiding Jolene in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So if he punches us won't be in big trouble\Nthat's why whenever his stance fists
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,make contact with something it'll be\Ninverted and I don't know how far but with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,everything sideways we're just gonna\Nkeep falling so this is it thanks to the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,unique energy around Cape Canaveral the\Npriest has somehow developed a new stand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for human beings to attain happiness\Nthey must first overcome their destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the obstacles Dio and I must overcome\NAre you damn Joestars in your bloodline?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart has been turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't working before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this text be from...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, you've got to find Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Jolene is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Her heart should have\Nbeen turned inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline is something I\Nmust overcome, no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to protect Jolene, I'm gonna\Nhave to kill that fucking priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,will
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,be the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,future of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware that she doesn't have\Nthe capability to move her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is she still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I somehow miss her\Nvital points by accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, I hit her heart dead on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have turned inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the Joestar bloodline\Nand the blood of that damn Kujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what's trying to hinder the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that Dio and I have\Nbeen working to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that I end Jolene Kujo\Nhere, no matter what lengths I must go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the times Jolene has\Ninterfered with my plan within
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the prison and in Orlando have\Nbeen tests on my path to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Father Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the one who walks the\Npath with fate on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plan goes beyond\Npetty feelings of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio and I will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a soul in the world\Ncapable of getting in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really use a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my hip bone's pretty messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The place where Jolene\Nfell should be around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a scrap of Jolene's clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning it's likely that she wound\Nup falling into this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the fool sneaking up behind\Nme, I suggest you not come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not consider you a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even pose a threat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back, Seamoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Diver Drive can phase into more than\Njust walls in the ground, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He was one of the tourists who\Ndied from your gravity ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I changed his bone structure from\Nthe inside and turned him into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're already within my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver, drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned himself inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,your significance is\Neven less than Sun Wukong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,as he bounced around in the Buddha's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Something just touched my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Jolene Kujo's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What on God's green earth is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she still able to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have suffered a grave injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is telling me that I must\Npursue her with everything I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to end her permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Given that he'll be\Nlooking for his daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that Jotaro Kujo\Nwill be arriving here any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will be a real\Nnuisance if Anastasia regains
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.24,0:08:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,his composure and tries\Nto come for me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that everyone is gathering to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,this location in order\Nto protect Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is the case, what's most significant\Nright now is that you perish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They all believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is your death that will shatter the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,hearts of everyone who\Nis heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Jotaro, who will\Nbe losing his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough to strip him of his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,reason to live and the\Nstrength in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He will no longer be a\Nthreat to either me or Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be now, in this very place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find you no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Jolene and Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just her strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, she's behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to devote my entire being\Nto snuffing out your life right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already aware you've\Nsuffered a severe injury!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The gravity pulls in the opposite\Ndirection of wherever my feet are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything falls towards me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I got you with a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now both of your arms are as good as gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of her arms should\Nhave been inverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out now, Jolene Cujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attempts to stop me are futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy Mother of God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that shape in her chest\Nwhere her heart should be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,STONE OCEAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Mobius Strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you're creating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You start by tracing the surface with\Nyour finger and from there keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,if you continue to trace without ever\Nlifting your finger from the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you realize that you've somehow ended\Nup on the other side but after going
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,around the entire length of it you\Nfind yourself back at the starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This shape with no\Nfrontside or backside was
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,discovered in the 19th century by a German
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,mathematician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.61,0:12:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In honor of him, the shape\Nwas dubbed the Mobius Strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for it to invert, it\Nwould need more than one surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but it has no concept
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,of inside or outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The shape known as the Band of\NInfinity, she was able to make one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,with her thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is only one possible\Nmoment where she could have made it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and that That's the very moment when Seamoon\Nstruck her in the heart with its fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The first person to have ever\Neaten a mushroom has my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It might have been poisonous, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it just some lucky\Nfool that happened to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,eat it and everything\Nturned out to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,was it a final act of desperation fueled\Nby hunger that spurred this discovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's test a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take a direct blow to your\Nbrain, can you still stay alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need is one. But\Nfrom which direction shall
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I strike you down just a\Nsingle blow to your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is all that it will\Ntake so that's it huh if
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you're coming at me you\Nbetter give it your all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm biding my\Ntime for the perfect moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To assure my survival,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been observing you closely\Nas I circle around and corner you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for the precise moment that\NI shall finally achieve victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As I continue to walk\Naround you in circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,all kinds of various objects will begin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,falling into place in\Nthe area surrounding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for my fated moment\Nof victory to gravitate toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With those dire wounds and\Nthe Mobius strip you've made,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think you'll be able to avoid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The corpse of the security guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And his gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:15:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Courtesy of the Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They fired the spear from three\Nkilometers up in the air and managed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to drive it straight into the\Nground here at the visitor's center.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Using my stand smack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it so the one spear split into two,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I peeled the sticker off, it\Ntried its best to come back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I held on to the spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it still pulled me three\Nkilometers towards the other
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,spear at an extremely fast\Nrate regardless of gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the same principle to get here\Nby dividing the spear a few more times,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,all while following where he\Nsensed that Jolene was located.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, Kujo, and Hermes\Nmade it at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got you\Nsurrounded, Father Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea that your stand\Nwill reach its completed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,state in 36 hours is just\Nyour twisted fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any more\Nallies to help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and you won't ever be\Nable to see the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that fate is\Ntruly on my side and is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,serving me with one last\Ntest to prove my worthiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What I thought was a hindrance\Nbecame exactly what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, the Joestar\Nbloodline is here to lend me aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After my body was forcefully thrown into\Nthis frame, I finally saw the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That the Kujos have been\Nmy allies all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is that damn priest\Nfloating up towards the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:18:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said before, gravity is\Nworking with me as its center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand everything\Nnow, Dio. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer need to wait for the\Nnew moon to arrive in 36 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If what I require for this\Nto work is the gravitational
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,effect which is created\Nduring the new moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then all I have to do is\Nstay afloat and keep rising
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,until I can discover those\Nexact gravitational conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And from there I'll have found it, the\Nspot with the same pull as the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for my sea\Nmoon to become complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,there must be an optimal position\Nwith which it'll activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're gonna let you get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep struggling all you want, but\Nthis is over for you, Poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Locate the right position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down by counting the prime numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteen, seventeen, nineteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch is mumbling\Nsomething under his breath up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His gravity hasn't changed yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's still being\Npulled parallel to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes, take a look at the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab that gun he dropped earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tightly to the railing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up that gun and take the shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,C-MOON!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Start Platinum! The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were a baton man, I'd say you're gonna\Nuse your stand to deflect those bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But time has been stopped\Nfor a total of five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't even be able to\Nsee this spear coming at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When time goes back to normal, that\Nspear will fly straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more seconds, two\Nseconds, one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time will resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The spear missed its mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It moved slightly during the time stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's trying to\Nget inside the space shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and now this thing is\Nstarting to float in the air too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest is taking shelter in the\Ngoddamn displaced space shuttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to avoid the spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.22,0:21:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's just\Ntrying to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.32,0:21:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have discovered something\Nthat's giving him the advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he actually find the missing\Nelement to complete his ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the ones who have been\Nhelping to raise me up all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were in prison, you\Nhave been there, lending me aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Father who art in heaven, I\Nbeseech you to lead and guide me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you to please watch over me, so\NI may not walk down the wrong path!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to your very will that\NI shall dedicate myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:23:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.64,0:23:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.02,0:23:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
